WEBVTT

00:02.360 --> 00:19.700
[úvodná hudba]

00:34.700 --> 00:38.360
[zvuky]

00:38.480 --> 00:42.100
Dobre, poďme na to. Sústreď sa. Rýchlosť.

00:42.720 --> 00:44.360
Ja som rýchlosť.

00:46.880 --> 00:49.120
Jeden víťaz, štyridsať porazených.

00:49.560 --> 00:51.640
Porazených si dávam na raňajky.

00:54.280 --> 00:54.820
Raňajky?

00:55.760 --> 00:59.040
Možno som si mal dať raňajky.
Určite by mi padli dobre.

00:59.120 --> 01:01.240
Nie, nie, nie, nerozptyľuj sa. Rýchlosť.

01:03.300 --> 01:06.760
Som rýchlejší ako rýchly,
dravší ako dravý. Som bleskový.

01:07.980 --> 01:09.520
Hej, Blesk, pripravený?

01:10.100 --> 01:13.920
[hudba] Ó áno, Blesk je

01:14.060 --> 01:14.940
pripravený.

01:14.950 --> 01:16.650
[spieva]

01:17.780 --> 01:21.580
I'm American made, Bud Light, Chevrolet.

01:22.100 --> 01:24.880
My mama taught me wrong from right.

01:26.020 --> 01:29.880
I was born in the south.
Sometimes I have a big mouth.

01:29.980 --> 01:32.760
When I see something that I don't like.

01:33.620 --> 01:34.920
I gotta say it.

01:37.840 --> 01:41.300
We've been driving this road for a mighty
long

01:41.440 --> 01:44.360
time. Paying no mind to the

01:44.400 --> 01:48.060
signs.
Well now this neighborhood's changed.

01:48.080 --> 01:51.780
It's all been rearranged. We left
that change

01:51.880 --> 01:55.220
somewhere behind. Put your thigh on it.

01:55.380 --> 01:59.180
Slow down, you're gonna crash. Lady

01:59.300 --> 02:02.460
in the screaming,
it's a blind man's blast.

02:03.520 --> 02:06.300
Look out, baby, got your blinders on.

02:06.480 --> 02:09.820
Everybody's looking for a way to get real

02:09.920 --> 02:11.940
gone. Real gone.

02:18.860 --> 02:22.680
There's a new cat in town.
He's got high paid friends.

02:23.160 --> 02:25.520
Thinks he's gonna change history.

02:26.720 --> 02:30.180
You think you know him somewhere. Yeah,
you think he's so

02:30.280 --> 02:34.080
square.
But it's just a major written prophecy.

02:34.860 --> 02:38.290
Come on now. Slow down, you're gonna

02:38.440 --> 02:41.720
crash. Lady in the screaming,
it's a blind man's blast.

02:41.820 --> 02:43.500
Kukni sa z tej autičky.

02:44.769 --> 02:47.040
Look out, you got your blinders on.

02:47.160 --> 02:49.840
Everybody's looking for a way.

02:50.220 --> 02:51.000
Ideš zle!

02:51.560 --> 02:53.820
Get real gone.

02:53.940 --> 02:55.400
To je ono, ty kitán!

02:55.500 --> 02:56.620
Real gone.

02:59.580 --> 03:01.560
Real gone.

03:02.900 --> 03:05.640
Real gone.

03:07.720 --> 03:08.100
Uh.

03:08.700 --> 03:22.940
[zvuky]

03:23.100 --> 03:25.460
Vitajte späť na štyristo míľ Dinoco.

03:25.680 --> 03:29.060
Ja som Bob Cutlass a vedľa mňa je môj
priateľ Darrell Cartrip.

03:29.120 --> 03:32.420
Zažívame možno historický deň
automobilového športu.

03:32.460 --> 03:34.360
Tlak oleja mi vystúpil až po strechu.

03:34.400 --> 03:37.740
Ešte chvíľu a budú ma musieť odtiahnuť z
komentátorskej kabíny.

03:38.040 --> 03:41.600
Je to tak, Darrell.
Tri autá a rovnaký počet bodov pred

03:41.640 --> 03:45.180
záverečnými pretekmi sezóny.
Práve víťaz dnešných pretekov vyhrá

03:45.240 --> 03:49.020
titul a Piston Cup. Získa Strip Weathers,
King, kráľ

03:49.060 --> 03:52.790
okruhov,
ešte jedno víťazstvo pred odchodom do

03:52.940 --> 03:55.570
Celé roky bol zlatou baňou spoločnosti
Dinoco.

03:55.740 --> 03:57.630
Získa pre ňu ešte jeden Piston Cup?

03:58.000 --> 04:01.200
A na druhom mieste ako vždy Chick Hicks.

04:01.580 --> 04:04.120
Celú svoju kariéru strávil v závese za
Kingom.

04:04.340 --> 04:08.100
Chick si myslel, že toto bude jeho rok,
že sa konečne vymení z Kingovho

04:08.200 --> 04:10.840
tieňa. Ale to posledné, čo čakal, bol

04:11.880 --> 04:13.100
Blesk McQueen.

04:13.340 --> 04:17.220
Myslím, že toto nečakal nikto.
Sezónu začínal ako neznámy

04:17.260 --> 04:19.920
bažant. Teraz ho už pozná každý.

04:20.220 --> 04:24.100
Bude prvým nováčikom,
ktorý vyhral Piston Cup a bude jazdiť za

04:24.380 --> 04:27.800
Legenda, večne druhý a zelenáč. Tri autá,

04:28.080 --> 04:29.160
jeden šampión.

04:29.290 --> 04:30.570
[spieva] Well here

04:31.560 --> 04:35.540
I come and I'm so not scared.
Got my leather jacket and I've got my

04:35.600 --> 04:39.040
hands in the air. But look out,

04:39.160 --> 04:41.880
take your blinders off.

04:42.080 --> 04:42.820
Toto nie!

04:42.900 --> 04:45.240
Everybody's looking for a way to get real
gone.

04:49.540 --> 04:51.340
Real gone. Real gone.

04:54.840 --> 04:56.140
Blesk, že ti to!

04:56.320 --> 05:00.180
Dostaň ich, McQueen, dostaň ich!

05:01.520 --> 05:03.420
Milujem

05:03.920 --> 05:06.340
autá!

05:06.440 --> 05:07.800
Dinoco bude moje.

05:08.960 --> 05:12.340
Problémy v zákrute tridsať. Ha,
skús tadiaľ prejsť, McQueen.

05:12.440 --> 05:14.560
Ou, veľká zrážka za lídrami.

05:36.820 --> 05:36.950
Pozor! [zvuky]

05:36.950 --> 05:39.120
Počkať, počkať.
McQueen kľučkuje medzi vrakmi.

05:39.280 --> 05:43.000
Tadiaľ v žiadnom prípade nemôže prejsť.
Teda nie ako jeden kus.

05:44.219 --> 05:57.160
[hudba]

05:57.960 --> 05:58.820
Áno.

05:59.360 --> 06:00.040
McQueen!

06:03.772 --> 06:05.692
Pozrite na to,
McQueen sa z nechtík dostal!

06:05.872 --> 06:08.732
Bleskový McQueen to urobil impozantne.

06:08.832 --> 06:10.112
Áno, kčau!

06:10.122 --> 06:13.822
[potlesk] McQueen, McQueen, McQueen,
McQueen, McQueen, McQueen!

06:14.092 --> 06:15.512
Nie, McQueen!

06:15.752 --> 06:17.092
Kčau!

06:17.332 --> 06:21.172
Zatiaľ čo všetky vozy idú do boxov,
McQueen zostáva na trati,

06:21.412 --> 06:24.152
Nesťahujte ma, tréner, ja ešte vládzem.

06:24.292 --> 06:28.932
[smiech]

06:29.832 --> 06:31.332
Čo na to vravíte? Nádhera.

06:31.362 --> 06:32.672
McQueen cez to prešiel.

06:32.732 --> 06:32.972
Čo?

06:33.272 --> 06:34.371
